<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-4625] .NET: MixedClusterTest leaves Java-only node running</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4625</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;MixedClusterTest causes consequent tests to fail in some situations because it leaves java-only &quot;grid2&quot; node running. Looks like ExecuteJavaTask does not stop node properly.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13038447">IGNITE-4625</key>
            <summary>.NET: MixedClusterTest leaves Java-only node running</summary>
